   "equations": [
    {
     "_comment": "Initial condition: the dump E_in interpolated to the fine grid, surface/atmosphere rows pinned to Enth_ks (the C++ surface Dirichlet row replaces the interpolated value there).",
     "lhs": {
      "op": "ic",
      "args": [
       "E_f"
      ]
     },
     "rhs": "E_f_init"
    },
    {
     "_comment": "Thermal diffusivity assembled once from the INITIAL enthalpy (enthSystemCtx::assemble_R runs before the solve). The basal entry switches on fine level 2 (the C++ R[0] special case R[0] depends on Enth[1]); interior/upper entries switch on their own level.",
     "lhs": "K",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "faq",
      "args": [],
      "output_idx": [
       "i"
      ],
      "ranges": {
       "i": {
        "from": "lev_f"
       }
      },
      "expr": {
       "op": "ifelse",
       "args": [
        {
         "op": "==",
         "args": [
          "i",
          1
         ]
        },
        {
         "op": "energy_thermal_diffusivity",
         "args": [
          {
           "op": "index",
           "args": [
            "E_f_init",
            2
           ]
          },
          {
           "op": "index",
           "args": [
            "E_cts",
            2
           ]
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "op": "energy_thermal_diffusivity",
         "args": [
          {
           "op": "index",
           "args": [
            "E_f_init",
            "i"
           ]
          },
          {
           "op": "index",
           "args": [
            "E_cts",
            "i"
           ]
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "_comment": "Marginal-column vertical velocity gate (enthSystemCtx::init).",
     "lhs": "w_eff",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "faq",
      "args": [],
      "output_idx": [
       "i"
      ],
      "ranges": {
       "i": {
        "from": "lev_f"
       }
      },
      "expr": {
       "op": "ifelse",
       "args": [
        {
         "op": "and",
         "args": [
          "marginal",
          "exclude_v_adv"
         ]
        },
        0.0,
        {
         "op": "index",
         "args": [
          "w_f",
          "i"
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "_comment": "Strain heating on rows 1..ks (0.5*Sigma/rho per the C++ RHS), excluded at marginal columns.",
     "lhs": "strain_term",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "faq",
      "args": [],
      "output_idx": [
       "i"
      ],
      "ranges": {
       "i": {
        "from": "lev_f"
       }
      },
      "expr": {
       "op": "ifelse",
       "args": [
        {
         "op": "and",
         "args": [
          "marginal",
          "exclude_strain_heat"
         ]
        },
        0.0,
        {
         "op": "ifelse",
         "args": [
          {
           "op": "<=",
           "args": [
            "i",
            "ks"
           ]
          },
          {
           "op": "/",
           "args": [
            {
             "op": "index",
             "args": [
              "sig_f",
              "i"
             ]
            },
            "rho_ice"
           ]
          },
          0.0
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "_comment": "Vertical enthalpy diffusion D(K*D(E_f,z),z), BOMBPROOF column stencil (energy_vertical_diffusion rewrites this compound at priority 10).",
     "lhs": "diffusion_term",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "D",
      "args": [
       {
        "op": "*",
        "args": [
         "K",
         {
          "op": "D",
          "args": [
           "E_f"
          ],
          "wrt": "z"
         }
        ]
       }
      ],
      "wrt": "z"
     }
    },
    {
     "_comment": "Vertical enthalpy advection stencil as it appears in the C++ tridiagonal. The C++ system is D x = RHS with D = I - dt*M, so the advection's contribution to the ODE dE/dt = M E + b is the NEGATIVE of this stencil (physical -w*dE/dz). The basal advection carries w[1]*A_b*G; w[1] = 0 at the base for the test columns (no basal melting), so the negation flips a zero.",
     "lhs": "adv_term",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "apply_expression_template",
      "args": [],
      "name": "energy_vertical_advection",
      "bindings": {
       "E": "E_f",
       "w": "w_eff"
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "_comment": "Explicit horizontal enthalpy advection at the frozen initial enthalpy (PISM evaluates the B-array at the OLD state), gated off at marginal columns.",
     "lhs": "hadv_term",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "apply_expression_template",
      "args": [],
      "name": "energy_horizontal_advection",
      "bindings": {
       "E": "E_f_init",
       "u": "u_f",
       "v": "v_f",
       "E_w": "E_w",
       "E_e": "E_e",
       "E_n": "E_north",
       "E_s": "E_south"
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "_comment": "The semi-discrete enthalpy equation: dE_f/dt = D(K D(E_f,z),z) - w dE_f/dz + horizontal advection + strain heating. Rows above the ice surface have identically zero RHS (all four terms vanish there), so the surface/atmosphere rows stay pinned at Enth_ks from the initial condition.",
     "lhs": {
      "op": "D",
      "args": [
       "E_f"
      ],
      "wrt": "t"
     },
     "rhs": {
      "op": "faq",
      "args": [],
      "output_idx": [
       "i"
      ],
      "ranges": {
       "i": {
        "from": "lev_f"
       }
      },
      "expr": {
       "op": "+",
       "args": [
        {
         "op": "index",
         "args": [
          "diffusion_term",
          "i"
         ]
        },
        {
         "op": "-",
         "args": [
          {
           "op": "index",
           "args": [
            "adv_term",
            "i"
           ]
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "op": "index",
         "args": [
          "hadv_term",
          "i"
         ]
        },
        {
         "op": "index",
         "args": [
          "strain_term",
          "i"
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "_comment": "Storage-grid output (ColumnInterpolation::fine_to_coarse_linear).",
     "lhs": "E_out",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "apply_expression_template",
      "args": [],
      "name": "energy_fine_to_coarse",
      "bindings": {
       "E": "E_f"
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "p_base",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "*",
      "args": [
       "rho_ice",
